{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stromer-st3-st5-and-st7-bicycles-fitted-with-wren-front-suspension-forks-2512-0123","content_id":"2a191ede-d197-4dd2-9f43-3eaea8429cd4","description":"Product Recall for Stromer ST3, ST5 and ST7 Bicycles fitted with WREN Front Suspension Forks presenting a risk of injuries. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"4c3b2d54-0722-4016-b87d-20ddd7db08a0","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-08T15:21:22+01:00","id":"4c3b2d54-0722-4016-b87d-20ddd7db08a0","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-08T15:21:22+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa019e25f6e942efe37ef00/2512-0123-product-recall-stromer-st3-st5-st7.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Stromer ST3, ST5 and ST7 Bicycles fitted with WREN Front Suspension Forks</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries as the suspension forks can fail prematurely and crack, break or separate during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment – Cycles (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Stromer</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Bike Models</td>\n      <td>ST3, ST5 and ST7 S-Pedelecs</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Fork Brand</td>\n      <td>WREN</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Switzerland</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Bikes with automatic pedal support fitted with WREN suspension forks.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_4c3b2d54-0722-4016-b87d-20ddd7db08a0\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa019e25f6e942efe37ef00/2512-0123-product-recall-stromer-st3-st5-st7.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of injuries as the suspension forks can fail prematurely and crack, break or separate during use. This means that the rider may lose control of the bike, leading to injuries.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users.  </p>\n\n<p>Stromer have contacted affected customers and advised that they stop using the bikes immediately. Replacement parts are in production. Consumers will be notified once parts become available and advised to take their bike to their nearest authorised dealer.  </p>\n\n<p>Update:  On 4th September 2026, the product recall was expanded.</p>\n\n<p>This recall expansion concerns a batch with modified design (oval hole vs round hole), due to the possibility that these forks present the same safety risks as the recalled WREN forks. Consumers who own bike that is fitted with a newly identified affected batch have been contacted directly and should contact their dealer to arrange for their front suspension fork to be replaced free of charge.</p>\n\n<p>Please contact <a href=\"mailto:safety@stromerbike.com\">safety@stromerbike.com</a> for further information, or visit: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.stromerbike.com/en/voluntary-recall\">https://www.stromerbike.com/en/voluntary-recall</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0123</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Recall scope expanded on 4th September 2026 to include an additional batch of WREN suspension forks installed on certain ST3 and ST5 models that may be affected by the same safety issue.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-15T14:18:21Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-12T16:20:45Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-12","product_risk_level":"medium"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-12T16:20:45+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stromer-st3-st5-and-st7-bicycles-fitted-with-wren-front-suspension-forks-2512-0123","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stromer-st3-st5-and-st7-bicycles-fitted-with-wren-front-suspension-forks-2512-0123","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stromer-st3-st5-and-st7-bicycles-fitted-with-wren-front-suspension-forks-2512-0123","content_id":"2a191ede-d197-4dd2-9f43-3eaea8429cd4","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-09-15T14:18:22Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Stromer ST3, ST5 and ST7 Bicycles fitted with WREN Front Suspension Forks (2512-0123)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stromer-st3-st5-and-st7-bicycles-fitted-with-wren-front-suspension-forks-2512-0123","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url